{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Staying Fresh",
    "steam_appid": 2875780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/d03fa21165fad92404a98a19572ae3f2.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh food lived peacefully in the fridge until a sudden power outage turned it into a breeding ground for rot. Now, culinary heroes fight for their freshness, fending off zombie food. Explore the abandoned kitchen, find ingredients, and uncover who sabotaged the fridge\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/1162a720ace9dc374f0656747f163ad3.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the perfect strategy: in minimalistic turn-based combat, you have the opportunity to study your opponent's attacks and find the best solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for scraps of recipe book pages to learn how to create new units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and collect ingredients to repair, upgrade and create new culinary warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities: a variety of levels, units and enemies open up endless horizons of possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/d70c133e1164022eeab80f3a234a6886.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=68 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/d03fa21165fad92404a98a19572ae3f2.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh food lived peacefully in the fridge until a sudden power outage turned it into a breeding ground for rot. Now, culinary heroes fight for their freshness, fending off zombie food. Explore the abandoned kitchen, find ingredients, and uncover who sabotaged the fridge\u2014before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/1162a720ace9dc374f0656747f163ad3.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the perfect strategy: in minimalistic turn-based combat, you have the opportunity to study your opponent's attacks and find the best solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for scraps of recipe book pages to learn how to create new units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and collect ingredients to repair, upgrade and create new culinary warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless possibilities: a variety of levels, units and enemies open up endless horizons of possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875780/extras/d70c133e1164022eeab80f3a234a6886.avif?t=1739368123\" width=616 height=68 /></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "Don't let the mold take over the kitchen and turn all fresh food into rotten zombies. Immerse yourself in tactical roguelite adventures: lead culinary heroes, fight off zombies. Upgrade your fighters with fresh ingredients. Discover new recipes while exploring the mysterious abandoned kitchen.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian",
